Updates:

Corrections made to the rendering of Thai language glyphs;
Added banner for Forbidden Fantasy, in the main menu https://store.steampowered.com/app/2638560/Forbidden_Fantasy

[url=http://oppai.me/bguC][img]https://cdn-uploads.oppaiman.com/6846890_24-05-2024-11-07-59-849_thumb0_statusupdate2.mp4.jpeg[/img][/url]
Hello, my dear FreshMen!

[b]We’ve got great news! FreshWomen Season 2 Episode 3 Part 1 is going to be released on June 7th![/b]

[b]Watch our weekly sneak peek video here: [url=http://oppai.me/status_update_05_24]http://oppai.me/status_update_05_24[/url] [/b]

[b]FreshWomen Season 2 Episode 3 Part 1 is a HUGE update[/b], and we’re very excited for you to play it! Our new character rig and production pipeline made our artists very effective, and we used this to [b]expand our content for this update, both in static images and in animations![/b] It’s our funniest update by far, has some very memorable scenes and a very, very hot sex scene with Lily!

[h3]FreshWomen Season 2 Episode 3 Part 1 has:[/h3]
[list]
[*] 30 minutes of fresh gameplay;
[*] 583 Renders;
[*] 37 animations;
[*] Voice Acting;
[*] Sexy sounds and moaning;
[*] 720p, 1080p and 4K options;
[*] Sweat, Mocap and Physics;
[*] HD Maps for all characters;
[*] Subtitles available in: Brazilian Portuguese, Chinese (Simplified), Chinese (Traditional) Czech, English, French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Spanish, Thai and Turkish;
[*]The beginning of the last story arc of Season 2;
[/list]
[h3]We’re almost, almost done with the production of FreshWomen Season 2 Episode 3 Part 1. Here’s our updated progress summary:[/h3]
[list]
[*][b] Blocking: [/b]DONE!;
[*] [b]Lighting:[/b] DONE, but, a few corrections are necessary;
[*] [b]Facial Expression:[/b] DONE!;
[*] [b]Cloth Simulation and Polish:[/b] 7 scenes done, 2 in progress, 0 to go;
[*] [b]Animations:[/b] 26 animations done, 7 in progress, 4 to go;
[*] [b]Characters, Script and Storyboards are done![/b]
[*] [b]Voice Acting is done![/b]
[/list]
I’ve been playing a lot of Season 2 Episode 3 Part 1, editing, changing things, making improvements, and honestly, [b]this is an amazing update![/b] Flowing with emotion, fun and sexiness! We’ll release an Alpha Build to a few selected testers next week to collect feedbacks and ensure everything is as perfect as it can be.
[b]
[h3]In other news, Forbidden Fantasy Chapter 3 is coming strong, and we should see a new release in a few weeks! Here is our progress summary:[/h3][/b]
[list]
[*][b] Blocking:[/b] DONE!;
[*][b] Lighting: [/b]5 scenes done, 4 in progress, 0 to go;
[*][b] Facial Expression: [/b]3 scenes done, 2 in progress, 4 to go;
[*][b] Cloth Simulation and Polish:[/b] 2 scenes done, 1 in progress, 6 to go;
[*] [b]Animations: [/b]2 done, 26 in progress, 0 to go;
[*][b] Characters, Script and Storyboards are done![/b]
[*] [b]Voice Acting is done![/b]
[/list]
Chapter 3 is stunning, and the [b]Zhara sex scene is very impressive![/b] It is an exciting update, with lots of adventure, new characters, and [b]Zhara is SO HOT[/b] in it!

[h3]We also had a lot of progress at Oppaiman.com, and our partners are releasing FANTASTIC games at our store. Here are a few of the latest releases:[/h3]
[list]
[*] [b]Treasure of Nadia:[/b] [url=http://oppai.me/treasure_of-nadia]http://oppai.me/treasure_of-nadia[/url]
[*] [b]Projekt Passion:[/b] [url=http://oppai.me/projekt_passion-season-1-and-2-v-0-11]http://oppai.me/projekt_passion-season-1-and-2-v-0-11[/url]
[*] [b]Prince of Suburbia:[/b] [url=http://oppai.me/prince_of-suburbia-parts-1-2_1]http://oppai.me/prince_of-suburbia-parts-1-2_1[/url]
[*] [b]Eternum (Free Game):[/b] [url=http://oppai.me/eternum]http://oppai.me/eternum[/url]
[*] [b]Summer Heat (Free Game):[/b] [url=http://oppai.me/3gxb]http://oppai.me/3gxb[/url]
[*] [b]Once In a Lifetime (Free Game):[/b] [url=http://oppai.me/once_in-a-lifetime]http://oppai.me/once_in-a-lifetime[/url]
[*] [b]What A Legend (Free Game):[/b] [url=http://oppai.me/pgcp]http://oppai.me/pgcp[/url]
[/list]
[b]Soon, we’ll have even more games at Oppaiman.com![/b] We want to create a highly specialized store, focused on the wants and needs of NSFW devs and players, and transform the market! Thanks to your support and to our partners' collaboration, we’re already on our way to becoming a hub for NSFW gamers!

Thank you for your support, for all your feedbacks, and for being with us on this amazing journey! [b]It’s a huge pleasure to create this games with you!
[/b]
See you soon,

